{"id":"102ae3001d5e421b","group":"58","path":"58/batch16/58-df-zfc-set12-image-restriction.md","title":"ZFC Set12 Image Restriction","display":"df-zfc-set12-image-restriction — ZFC Set12 Image Restriction","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-set12-image-restriction","aliases":["58-df-zfc-set12-image-restriction"],"display":"df-zfc-set12-image-restriction — ZFC Set12 Image Restriction","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-image]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-set12-image-restriction"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-set12-image-restriction</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-set12-image-restriction — ZFC Set12 Image Restriction"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"97c28eede56ea5e4\" href=\"?note=97c28eede56ea5e4\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-domain\">58-df-zfc-rel-domain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c189b9b31702b9de\" href=\"?note=c189b9b31702b9de\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-image\">58-df-zfc-rel-image</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,f,A\\in V\">\\(Y,f,A\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (typed function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (relation-image predicate)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ImageRestriction}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ImageRestriction}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}image\\text{-}restriction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12ImageRestriction}_S(Y,f,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land \\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S\\!\\left(Y,f,A\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}image\\text{-}restriction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12ImageRestriction}_S(Y,f,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land \\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S\\!\\left(Y,f,A\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the image of the part of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> on which <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> is defined; the explicit intersection avoids applying <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> outside its domain.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-domain","status":"resolved","id":"97c28eede56ea5e4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-domain]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-image","status":"resolved","id":"c189b9b31702b9de","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (typed function predicate, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Y,f,A\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcSet12ImageRestriction}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}set12\\text{-}image\\text{-}restriction} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcSet12ImageRestriction}_S(Y,f,A)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Function}(f,\\operatorname{dom}(f),\\operatorname{ran}(f))\\land \\mathrm{ZfcRelImage}_S\\!\\left(Y,f,A\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false}],"bytes":1091,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3429","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-set12-image-restriction.md|58-df-zfc-set12-image-restriction]]（batch16）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","36d7463d215be751","97c28eede56ea5e4","c189b9b31702b9de"]}